    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <h1 id="hilo-title">High &amp; Low Elevation Maize Adaptation Genomes \(HiLo\)</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">
        De novo chromosome-scale reference genome assemblies, gene models, and altitudinal adaptation genomics for traditional Mexican landraces and CIMMYT inbred lines across 50 to 2,520 meters above sea level.
      </p>

      <div class="hilo-hero-actions-row">
        <a class="hilo-hero-link" href="/genomebrowser">
          <span class="hilo-link-dot hilo-dot-green" aria-hidden="true"></span> JBrowse 2
        </a>
